Domain: miconic
Problem: mixed-f4-p2-u0-v0-g0-a0-n0-a0-b0-n0-f0-r0
Require:
  :conditional-effects
  :strips
  :typing
Type:
  floor - object
  object
  passenger - object
Obj:
  f0 - floor
  f1 - floor
  f2 - floor
  f3 - floor
  p0 - passenger
  p1 - passenger
Predicate:
  (= object object) :eq
  (NOT-served passenger) neg-of (served)
  (above floor floor)
  (boarded passenger)
  (destin passenger floor)
  (lift-at floor)
  (origin passenger floor)
  (served passenger) neg-of (NOT-served)
Function:
Action:
  down: ?f1 - floor ?f2 - floor
      pre: (and (above ?f2 ?f1) (lift-at ?f1))
      eff: (and (lift-at ?f2) (not (lift-at ?f1)))
  stop: ?f - floor
      pre: (and (lift-at ?f))
      eff: (and (when (and (NOT-served p0) (origin p0 ?f)) (boarded p0)) (when (and (NOT-served p1) (origin p1 ?f)) (boarded p1)) (when (and (boarded p0) (destin p0 ?f)) (and (not (NOT-served p0)) (not (boarded p0)) (served p0))) (when (and (boarded p1) (destin p1 ?f)) (and (not (NOT-served p1)) (not (boarded p1)) (served p1))))
  up: ?f1 - floor ?f2 - floor
      pre: (and (above ?f1 ?f2) (lift-at ?f1))
      eff: (and (lift-at ?f2) (not (lift-at ?f1)))
Init:
  (NOT-served p0)
  (NOT-served p1)
  (above f0 f1)
  (above f0 f2)
  (above f0 f3)
  (above f1 f2)
  (above f1 f3)
  (above f2 f3)
  (destin p0 f2)
  (destin p1 f3)
  (lift-at f0)
  (origin p0 f3)
  (origin p1 f1)
Goal:
  (and (served p0) (served p1))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (NOT-served passenger): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (above floor floor): in_init in_pre
  (boarded passenger): in_pre in_eff
  (destin passenger floor): in_init in_pre
  (lift-at floor): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (origin passenger floor): in_init in_pre
  (served passenger): in_goal in_eff
Func prop:
Global prop:
  has_cond_eff
  is_unit_cost
